5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that doesn't alienate newcomers or make the club feel overly rigid.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. We should also consider the administrative burden on whoever manages the funds.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It would be wise to see if the current usage of the club is actually balanced across the membership.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I've noticed a certain hesitation in the air lately. We should find out why people are wavering.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't just guess the numbers again. We need to know exactly what we're dealing with financially.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I'll look into the taster evening forms and the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I'll check the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'll examine the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll look at the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm going for the last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
